 R←Test_51(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;H;state;count;full;byTime;fulls;byTimes;signature;ceiling;resetAfter;repeatAfter;t0;hour
⍝ `StormRule`: an error that occurs once an hour for five days gets the full treatment at hours 0, 1, 3, 7, 15
⍝ and 31 by its count, and from then on once every `stormRepeatAfter` (24) hours
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')
 R←T._Failed

 H←##.HandleError
 state←H.NewStormState
 signature←'11 Foo[6]'
 ceiling←100
 resetAfter←24
 repeatAfter←24
 t0←1000000
 fulls←⍬
 byTimes←⍬
 :For hour :In ¯1+⍳120
     (state count full byTime)←H.StormRule state signature(t0+3600×hour)ceiling resetAfter repeatAfter
     fulls,←full
     byTimes,←byTime
 :EndFor

 →T.GoToTidyUp 0 1 3 7 15 31 55 79 103≢¯1+⍸fulls
 →T.GoToTidyUp 55 79 103≢¯1+⍸byTimes               ⍝ Those the count alone would not have granted
 →T.GoToTidyUp 120≢count
 →T.GoToTidyUp(,104)≢state.lastFulls
 →T.GoToTidyUp(,t0+3600×103)≢state.lastFullTimes

 R←T._OK

